    "Did you ever use AI to support your math learning in the last year? If yes, how was your experience?": "No—my approach is self-study with textbooks and online forums (like Khan Academy). I’d love to try an AI tutor if it could break down proofs differently or explain steps intuitively. Something that adapts to my neuroticism levels might help more than rigid lectures.",
